# Personal publish target

When the user asks to **publish**, **deploy**, **share**, or **update the link**:

1. **Do not** push to or open a PR against `zendesk/admin-copilot-prototype` (`origin`).
2. Commit locally if needed, then push to the **`personal`** remote:
   - Repo: https://github.com/suhailshaikh13/admin-copilot-launchpad-prototype
   - Remote name: `personal`
   - Branch mapping: current work → `personal/main`
3. Rebuild (`npm run build`) and update **GitHub Pages** on that same personal repo (`gh-pages` branch with `dist/` only).
4. Shareable demo URL (keep this updated):
   - https://suhailshaikh13.github.io/admin-copilot-launchpad-prototype/
